flowchart TD
    A[User request] --> B[Observe current state]
    B --> C[Choose next action]
    C --> D{Stop or use tool}
    D -->|Tool| E[Validate tool and arguments]
    E --> F[Execute bounded tool]
    F --> G[Append observation]
    G --> B
    D -->|Final| H[Return answer]
    C --> I[Check step and cost budget]
    I -->|Exceeded| J[Stop safely]
